  "details": "I noticed yesterday that whenever I tabbed out or used the in game menu that my gestures would toggle back on after i had toggled them off. I usually find an expression for my avatar that fits the situation then toggle off the gestures since my controllers are a bit finicky when it comes to tracking the placement of my fingers when i play vrchat (which is probably another bug since I've heard other people deal with it too) and causes me to do unwanted gestures. This may not seem like a big deal but it does effect my experience and make playing less enjoyable.",
